confirm.description:
A PC used the code:

- Host name: **{hostname}**
- OS: {os}
- Agent: {agent}
- Agent ID: {agent_id}
- Fingerprint: **{fingerprint}**

`torporctl pair` printed a host name and a fingerprint. If they match these, continue. If they don't, someone else used the code: cancel.

